This builds up on top of all the prior PRs that allow for easily encoding requests into simple `struct`s.
Prior to this, tests had to manually check the different parameters of requests (path, headers, body, method, etc.). Now it's all automatic and encoded together in the snapshot files.

Example snapshot:
```json
